  "title": "Return-Conditioned Causal Context",
  "introduction": "Decision Transformer conditions each action on at most the last K timesteps (3K tokens). This illustrative two-step example assumes K is at least 2, so both positions fit the context window. Offline actions supply supervised targets; deployment feeds a new state-action prefix and reduces the requested return by each observed reward.",
