      "title": "Generate and execute a deployment action",
      "explanation": "A separate deployment episode begins with requested return $G_1$ and observation $s_1^{\\mathrm{dep}}$. The model conditions on that ordered prefix, generates $a^*_1$, and appends the same action identity. The environment executes $a^*_1$; its reward and successor state remain unavailable until the transition completes. The retained training panels are only a prior illustrative snapshot, not deployment inputs.",
